<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Metamorph — Autonomous. Local. Always on.</title>
<meta name="description" content="The AI infrastructure partner your business actually needs. Local-first. Privacy-first." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter+Tight:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0A0A0A;
    --bg-2: #111111;
    --text: #FFFFFF;
    --text-muted: #888888;
    --text-dim: #555555;
    --border: #222222;
    --border-soft: #1A1A1A;
    --gold: #FBBF24;
    --rose: #F472B6;
    --display: 'Inter Tight', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --body: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    top: -200px;
    right: -300px;
    width: 700px;
    height: 700px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(244,114,182,0.10), transparent 65%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  body::after {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    bottom: -200px;
    left: -300px;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(251,191,36,0.08), transparent 65%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }
  .nav-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .nav-link {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-link:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .lang-switcher {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .lang-switcher .active { color: var(--gold); }

  /* BUTTONS */
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-family: var(--body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #0A0A0A;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #FCD34D;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    color: var(--gold);
    background: transparent;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(251,191,36,0.08);
  }
  .btn-sm {
    padding: 8px 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    padding: 120px 0 80px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 80px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -2.5px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    max-width: 880px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FBBF24 55%, #F472B6 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .hero p.lead {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--text);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* STATS */
  .stats {
    padding: 60px 0 80px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    margin-top: 60px;
  }
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }
  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .stat-icon {
    font-size: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FBBF24, #F472B6);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .stat-value {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* SECTION */
  .section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }
  .section-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .section-lead {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* SERVICES */
  .service-main {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(251,191,36,0.04), rgba(244,114,182,0.02));
    position: relative;
  }
  .service-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #0A0A0A;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .service-main h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .service-main p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    max-width: 540px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .service-main .btn {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .services-mini {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .service-mini {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--bg-2);
  }
  .service-mini-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .service-mini h4 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .service-mini p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .services-footer-note {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .services-footer-note strong {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta {
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-inner {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .cta h2 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -1.6px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FBBF24 65%, #F472B6 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .cta p {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  /* CONTACT FORM */
  .contact-form {
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .contact-form input,
  .contact-form textarea {
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--body);
    font-size: 14px;
    width: 100%;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .contact-form input:focus,
  .contact-form textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }
  .contact-form textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 100px;
  }
  .contact-form button {
    align-self: center;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    padding: 40px 0 32px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .container { padding: 0 20px; }
    .hero { padding: 60px 0 40px; }
    .stats { padding: 40px 0 60px; margin-top: 40px; }
    .section { padding: 60px 0; }
    .nav-links { gap: 16px; }
    .nav-links .nav-link:not(:last-child) { display: none; }
    .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .services-mini { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .service-main { padding: 28px 24px; }
    .service-tag { position: static; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Metamorph</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#services" class="nav-link">Services</a>
        <a href="#about" class="nav-link">About</a>
        <div class="lang-switcher">
          <span class="active">US</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>ES</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://app.metamorphworld.com" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Client login</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Autonomous.<br/>Local.<br/>Always on.</h1>
    <p class="lead">The AI infrastructure partner your business actually needs.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary">Get started →</a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn btn-secondary">See services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-icon">◆</div>
        <div class="stat-value">24/7</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Continuous monitoring</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-icon">◈</div>
        <div class="stat-value">100%</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Local AI · zero cloud</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-icon">◊</div>
        <div class="stat-value">Instant</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Alerts that matter</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">// Services</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Built for businesses that can't afford to fail.</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Local-first AI for clinics, law firms, accountants, and the businesses too important to send their data to the cloud.</p>

    <div class="service-main">
      <span class="service-tag">AVAILABLE NOW</span>
      <h3>Sentinel</h3>
      <p>Continuous infrastructure monitoring with local AI analysis. Llama 3 reads your logs, hardware metrics, and authentication attempts — then translates them into plain English alerts the moment something matters.</p>
      <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-secondary">Learn more</a>
    </div>

    <div class="services-mini">
      <div class="service-mini">
        <span class="service-mini-tag">Coming soon</span>
        <h4>Guardian</h4>
        <p>Automated compliance audits for HIPAA, GDPR, and regional regulations — without sending data anywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-mini">
        <span class="service-mini-tag">Coming soon</span>
        <h4>Mirror</h4>
        <p>Disaster recovery and real-time backup orchestration across your local infrastructure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-mini">
        <span class="service-mini-tag">Coming soon</span>
        <h4>Oracle</h4>
        <p>Predictive failure detection — know your hardware will fail before it actually does.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="services-footer-note">
      We also build <strong>custom AI solutions</strong> for businesses with unique needs. Talk to us.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta" id="cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <h2>Ready to level up?</h2>
      <p>Tell us about your business. We'll get back within 24 hours.</p>

      <form class="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xlgvrwpr" method="POST">
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required />
        <input type="text" name="company" placeholder="Company" />
        <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us what you need" required></textarea>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send message →</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    © 2026 Metamorph · metamorphworld.com
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
